Package: legiontoolkit
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 polkit,
 libgtk-4-1,
 libadwaita-1-0,
Description: Native control panel for Lenovo Legion laptops
 A GTK 4 / libadwaita control panel for Lenovo Legion laptops: power modes,
 thermals and fan speed, the GPU working mode, battery charging, the 24-zone
 RGB keyboard, and named power presets.
 .
 Reads are unprivileged; each write escalates through polkit to a small helper
 binary, so the application itself never runs as root. The package builds
 against GTK 4.22 / libadwaita 1.9, which Ubuntu ships from 25.10 (questing)
 onward. The optional out-of-tree legion_laptop kernel module is not required:
 batteries, readings and the sensor row work without it.
